" ============================================================================
" 9. Completion optimization (mucomplete + UltiSnips + auto-pairs)
"    补全协同优化（mucomplete + UltiSnips + auto-pairs）
" ============================================================================
" Plugin variables must be set before plug#end() loads plugins.
" 插件级变量必须在 plug#end() 前设置才会生效。
" Tab / S-Tab: forward/backward in the mucomplete popup.
" Tab / S-Tab：在 mucomplete 补全菜单中前后选择。
imap <silent> <Tab>   <Plug>(MUcompleteFwd)
imap <silent> <S-Tab> <Plug>(MUcompleteBwd)

" <CR> cooperation logic:
"   - if popup visible: accept candidate; if it is a [snip] item, expand it.
"   - otherwise: normal CR, then auto-pairs' return handling.
" <CR> 协同逻辑：
"   - 补全菜单出现时：接受候选；若为 [snip] 片段则展开 UltiSnips。
"   - 无菜单时：先执行普通回车，再执行 auto-pairs 的括号内缩进逻辑。
function! CompleteCRUltiExpand() abort
  if pumvisible()
    " Deal with both plain completion and [snip] expansion.
    " 同时处理普通补全与 [snip] 片段展开。
    return mucomplete#ultisnips#expand_snippet("")
  endif
  return "\<CR>\<Plug>AutoPairsReturn"
endfunction
inoremap <silent> <expr> <Plug>UltiExpand CompleteCRUltiExpand()
imap <CR> <Plug>UltiExpand

" Space handling: give mucomplete/Space priority when popup is open,
" otherwise call auto-pairs' Space logic.
" 空格处理：补全菜单打开时原样输出空格，否则调用 auto-pairs 的空格逻辑。
imap <silent> <expr> <Space> pumvisible()
      \ ? "\<Space>"
      \ : "\<C-r>=AutoPairsSpace()\<CR>"

