" Disable backtick auto-pair in TeX files (single and triple backticks).
" 在 TeX 文件中禁用反引号自动成对（单个和三个反引号）。
" auto-pairs creates b:AutoPairs on BufEnter; our hook runs after it, and a
" zero timer guarantees b:AutoPairs is populated first.
" auto-pairs 在 BufEnter 创建 b:AutoPairs；我们随后执行，零延时 timer
" 保证 b:AutoPairs 已初始化。
function! s:RemoveTexBacktickPairs(timer) abort
    if exists('b:AutoPairs')
        if has_key(b:AutoPairs, '`')
            call remove(b:AutoPairs, '`')
        endif
        if has_key(b:AutoPairs, '```')
            call remove(b:AutoPairs, '```')
        endif
    endif
    " Removing the dict keys is not enough: auto-pairs already created a
    " buffer-local insert mapping for backtick.  Unmap it too so typing ` is
    " never intercepted by auto-pairs in TeX buffers.
    " 仅删除字典键不够：auto-pairs 已为反引号创建 buffer 级 insert 映射。
    " 必须同时 unmap，使 TeX 中输入 ` 不再被 auto-pairs 拦截。
    silent! execute 'iunmap <buffer> `'
endfunction
augroup vimrc_autopairs_tex
    autocmd!
    autocmd BufEnter *
        \ if &filetype ==# 'tex' |
        \   call timer_start(0, function('s:RemoveTexBacktickPairs')) |
        \ endif
augroup END

