" Refresh the native mutedstatus colours.
" Highlight groups only depend on the theme and 'background' (active/inactive
" is resolved per-window at render time), so a refresh just recomputes the
" groups. mutedstatus#Setup() installs both the statusline and the
" refresh autocmds.
" 刷新原生 mutedstatus 的颜色。高亮组只依赖主题与 'background'（活动/
" 非活动在渲染时逐窗口解析），因此刷新只需重算高亮组。mutedstatus#Setup()
" 会同时安装状态栏与刷新自动命令。
function! RefreshStatusline() abort
    silent! call mutedstatus#Refresh()
endfunction

augroup vimrc_overwrite
    autocmd!
    " Reload config while editing itself, then refresh the statusline.
    " 编辑本 vimrc 时保存即自动加载，然后刷新状态栏。
    autocmd BufWritePost .vimrc,vimrc source <afile> | call RefreshStatusline()
augroup END

